{"unit_id": "tag:01JN:statement", "translation": "利用注记<REF_0001>，可以证明概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的纤维积（fibre product）在局部赋环空间（locally ringed spaces）的范畴（category）中存在，并且是一个概形（scheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部赋环空间", "context": "作为对象或态射所在范畴的局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指定对象及态射所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形"}], "notes": []}
