{"unit_id": "tag:01JO:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n虽然我们已经证明概形（schemes）的纤维积（fibre products）存在，这里仍回顾其一般定义。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积，原文为复数"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JP:statement", "translation": "给定概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>，其<TEXTITOPEN_0001>纤维积（fibre product）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>，连同投影态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>，组成如下交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0006>，\n它在所有这类图（diagrams）中是泛的，见范畴（Categories）中的定义<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "各指定路径的复合一致的图"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图", "context": "定义中同类的交换图，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "被引用的 Stacks Project 章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JO:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n换言之，给定任意由概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）组成的实线交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>，\n存在唯一的虚线箭头（dotted arrow）使该图（diagram）交换（commute）。\n我们将证明几个引理，说明如何理解纤维积（fibre products）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "各指定路径的复合一致的图"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头", "context": "交换图中待确定的箭头"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "由所给态射构成的图"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "加入虚线箭头后图交换"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积，原文为复数"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JQ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是目标（target）相同的概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。若<MATH_0003>都是仿射的（affine），则<MATH_0004>是仿射的（affine）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "态射指向的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "描述概形的仿射性"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "描述概形的仿射性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JQ:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。由引理<REF_0001>，仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0004>是局部赋环空间（locally ringed spaces）的范畴（category）中的纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0005>。因此，它更是概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中的纤维积（fibre product）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "由环的谱给出的概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部赋环空间", "context": "作为对象或态射所在范畴的局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指定对象及态射所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指定对象及态射所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JR:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是目标（target）相同的概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。设<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>为纤维积（fibre product）。设<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>是开子概形（open subschemes），且<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>成立。\n则典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0011>是开浸入（open immersion），它将<MATH_0012>与<MATH_0013>等同起来。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "态射指向的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "由开子集诱导的子概形，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由给定数据自然确定的态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "概形的开浸入"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01JR:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是态射（morphisms），满足<MATH_0004>，此处将它们视为到<MATH_0005>的态射（morphisms）。那么它们作为到<MATH_0006>的态射（morphisms）也相同。\n由纤维积（fibre product）的泛性质（universal property），得到唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>。当然，这个态射（morphism）的像（image）包含在开子概形（open）<MATH_0008>中。\n因此，<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>与<MATH_0011>在<MATH_0012>上的一个纤维积（fibre product）。由纤维积（fibre products）的唯一性即得所述结果，见范畴（Categories）中的第<REF_0001>节。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "代数几何中的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射，原文为复数"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "范畴论的纤维积"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "刻画纤维积的泛性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "态射的像"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "此处为纤维积中的开子概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term":