{"unit_id": "tag:01JT:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的一个点（point），我们来构造上述那样的一个四元组（quadruple）。回顾一下，可以把<MATH_0003>看作态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，见引理<REF_0001>。这个态射（morphism）对应于态射（morphisms）<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>，它们满足<MATH_0007>。再次应用同一引理，得到点（points）<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>，它们都位于同一个点（point）<MATH_0010>之上，并得到域（field）映射（maps）<MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>，使得复合（compositions）\n<MATH_0013>\n和\n<MATH_0014>\n相同。换言之，我们得到一个环同态（ring map）\n<MATH_0015>。\n令<MATH_0016>为这个映射（map）的核（kernel）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n反过来，给定一个四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0017>，我们得到如下交换（commutative）的实线图（diagram）\n<MATH_0018>，\n见第<REF_0002>节的讨论。由此得到虚线箭头（dotted arrow）。相应的点（point）<MATH_0019>属于<MATH_0020>，它是<MATH_0021>的泛点（generic point）的像（image）。\n我们略去对这两个构造互逆（inverse）的验证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "compositions", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "dotted arrow", "target_term": "虚线箭头"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "互逆"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形上的点"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "描述纤维积上的点的数据"}, {"source_term